---
import "../styles/globals.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>モシラス — 雀荘アテンドシミュレーション</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="フリー雀荘の店長になって開店〜閉店まで卓を回し、売上を最大化するシミュレーションゲーム。"
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>🀄 モシラス</h1>
      <p class="tagline">
        フリー雀荘アテンドシミュレーション ―
        卓を立て、案内し、本走で埋め、合卓し、閉店までの売上を最大化せよ。
      </p>
    </header>

    <main id="app" class="app"><!-- ゲームはここに描画される --></main>

    <footer class="page-foot">
      <details>
        <summary>遊び方</summary>
        <ul>
          <li><b>客は希望卓を持って来店</b>：点5(ブルー)/点3(グリーン)/どちらでも。</li>
          <li><b>待ち客をクリックで選択</b>（最大4人）→「卓を立てる」。3人以下なら<b>本走</b>で店員を入れて対局可。</li>
          <li><b>場代</b>＝客1人×半荘ごとの売上。本走席は場代なし＝店員はあくまで人数合わせ。</li>
          <li><b>ラスハン/モシラス</b>：半荘前のコール。ラスハンは必ず抜ける、モシラスは抜けるかも。待ち客を待たせるか即案内するかの読み合い。</li>
          <li><b>交代</b>：東場の間だけ、本走席に待ち客を入れられる（客が点棒・親に納得すれば）。</li>
          <li><b>合卓</b>：半荘前の同レート2卓を1卓にまとめて本走店員を解放。</li>
          <li>待たせ過ぎ・帰宅時刻・資金切れで客は帰る。スペースキーで一時停止。</li>
        </ul>
      </details>
      <p class="credit">同一シードで遊ぶには URL に <code>?seed=12345</code> を付与。</p>
    </footer>

    <script>
      import "../game/main";
    </script>

    <style is:global>
      /* ===== ページ全体レイアウト ===== */
      .page-head {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 0.6rem 1rem 0.2rem;
      }
      .page-head h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      }
      .tagline {
        margin: 0.2rem 0 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
      }
      .app {
        max-width: 1280px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem 1.5rem;
      }

      /* ===== HUD ===== */
      .hud {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1.3fr 1.6fr;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        align-items: center;
        background: var(--surface-1);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--r-lg);
        padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
        box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
      }
      .clock-wrap,
      .rev-wrap {
        display: flex;
        align-items: baseline;
        gap: 0.5rem;
      }
      .clock-label,
      .rev-label {
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .clock {
        font-size: 1.7rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      }
      .rev {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--amber-ink);
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      }
      .day-track,
      .rep-track {
        height: 6px;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        border-radius: 4px;
        overflow: hidden;
        margin-top: 0.35rem;
      }
      .day-bar {
        height: 100%;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f59e0b, #ef4444);
      }
      .rep-bar {
        height: 100%;
      }
      .rep-text {
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
      }
      .hud-right {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.45rem;
      }
      .kpis {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        gap: 0.4rem;
      }
      .kpi {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        background: var(--surface-2);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--r-sm);
        padding: 0.3rem 0.25rem;
      }
      .kpi span {
        font-size: 0.62rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .kpi b {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      }
      /* ターン制: 「次のイベントへ」主ボタン */
      .advance-wrap {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: flex-end;
      }
      .btn-advance {
        width: 100%;
        background: var(--blue-bright);
        color: #fff;
        border: none;
        border-radius: var(--r-md);
        padding: 0.55rem 1rem;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.18);
      }

      /* ===== メイン3カラム ===== */
      .main {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.7fr 1fr 1.1fr;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        margin-top: 0.75rem;
        align-items: start;
      }
      .col-h {
        margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--ink);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.4rem;
      }
      .badge {
        background: var(--amber);
        color: #1a1206;
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 0 0.5rem;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      /* ===== コントロール（卓を立てる）===== */
      .control {
        background: var(--surface-1);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--r-md);
        padding: 0.7rem 0.8rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
        box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
      }
      .ctl-title {
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.55rem;
      }
      /* 手順ステップ（①②）*/
      .ctl-step {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        padding: 0.4rem 0.5rem;
        border-radius: var(--r-sm);
        margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
        background: transparent;
        border: 1px solid transparent;
        transition: background-color 0.15s;
      }
      .ctl-step.step-active {
        background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
        border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.45);
      }
      .step-num {
        flex-shrink: 0;
        width: 1.3rem;
        height: 1.3rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: var(--surface-3);
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
      }
      .step-active .step-num {
        background: var(--amber);
        color: #1a1206;
      }
      /* 待ち客がいるのに未操作なら、最初のステップを軽く点滅させて誘導 */
      @keyframes step-attention {
        0%,
        100% {
          box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(245, 158, 11, 0);
        }
        50% {
          box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.22);
        }
      }
      .ctl-step.step-attention {
        animation: step-attention 1.6s ease-in-out infinite;
      }
      .step-body {
        flex: 1;
        min-width: 0;
      }
      .step-label {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.3;
      }
      .step-sel {
        font-size: 0.74rem;
        color: var(--amber-ink);
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-top: 0.15rem;
        min-height: 1.05em;
      }
      .ctl-btns {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-top: 0.35rem;
      }
      .ctl-hint {
        margin-top: 0.5rem;
        padding-top: 0.5rem;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.45;
      }
      .btn {
        border: none;
        border-radius: var(--r-md);
        padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 0.84rem;
        color: white;
        box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.18);
      }
      .btn-blue {
        background: var(--blue-bright);
      }
      .btn-green {
        background: var(--green-bright);
      }

      /* ===== 卓カード ===== */
      .tables {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr));
        gap: 0.6rem;
      }
      .table-card {
        background: var(--surface-2);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-left: 3px solid var(--border-strong);
        border-radius: var(--r-md);
        padding: 0.6rem;
        box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
      }
      .tc-blue {
        border-left-color: var(--blue);
      }
      .tc-green {
        border-left-color: var(--green);
      }
      .thead {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.4rem;
        font-size: 0.74rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
      }
      .tc-no {
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 0.86rem;
      }
      .tc-status {
        margin-left: auto;
        color: var(--amber-ink);
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .tc-count {
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .track {
        height: 5px;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        border-radius: 3px;
        overflow: hidden;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      }
      .table-card .track .bar-fill {
        height: 100%;
      }
      .seats {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 0.35rem;
      }
      .seat {
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--r-sm);
        padding: 0.35rem 0.4rem;
        min-height: 48px;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.1rem;
      }
      .seat-empty {
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        color: var(--muted);
        border-style: dashed;
        border-color: var(--border-strong);
      }
      .seat-empty.seat-guide {
        color: var(--amber);
        border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.5);
        background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.06);
      }
      .seat-name {
        font-weight: 700;
        white-space: nowrap;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-overflow: ellipsis;
      }
      .seat-meta {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      }
      .seat-staff {
        border-color: #a78bfa;
        background: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.1);
      }
      .seat-badge {
        align-self: flex-start;
        background: #7c3aed;
        color: white;
        font-size: 0.6rem;
        border-radius: 4px;
        padding: 0 0.3rem;
      }
      .seat-low {
        border-color: #7f1d1d;
      }
      /* コールバッジ: 1文字（L=ラスハン / M=モシラス）の丸バッジ */
      .call {
        align-self: flex-start;
        min-width: 1.15rem;
        height: 1.15rem;
        line-height: 1.15rem;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .call-last {
        background: var(--red);
        color: white;
      }
      .call-mosh {
        background: var(--amber);
        color: #1a1206;
      }
      .tc-actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.3rem;
        margin-top: 0.5rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }
      .mini {
        background: var(--surface-3);
        color: var(--ink);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
        border-radius: var(--r-sm);
        padding: 0.32rem 0.7rem;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
      }
      .mini-staff {
        background: #5d3a96;
        border-color: #7c52bd;
        color: #fff;
      }
      .mini-swap {
        background: #18786b;
        border-color: #25a08f;
        color: #fff;
      }
      .mini-on {
        background: var(--amber);
        color: #1a1206;
        border-color: var(--amber);
      }
      /* 時間限定アクション（交代=東場のみ）を目立たせる淡いパルス */
      @keyframes mini-attention {
        0%,
        100% {
          box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(37, 99, 235, 0);
        }
        50% {
          box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(24, 120, 107, 0.3);
        }
      }
      .mini-attention {
        animation: mini-attention 1.4s ease-in-out infinite;
      }
      /* 卓カードの状態ヒント（今この卓で何ができるか） */
      .tc-hint {
        margin-top: 0.45rem;
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        line-height: 1.35;
        color: var(--muted);
        background: var(--surface-1);
        border: 1px dashed var(--border-strong);
        border-radius: var(--r-sm);
        padding: 0.3rem 0.4rem;
      }
      .tc-hint-time {
        color: var(--amber-ink);
        border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.5);
        background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08);
      }

      /* ===== 下部固定 進行バー（既定PCでは非表示・スマホで表示）===== */
      .advance-bar {
        display: none;
      }

      /* ===== ログ折りたたみ（既定PCでは常時展開）===== */
      .log-toggle-cb,
      .log-caret {
        display: none;
      }

      /* ===== 待ち客 ===== */
      .waiting {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.4rem;
        max-height: 64vh;
        overflow-y: auto;
        padding-right: 4px;
      }
      .wchip {
        background: var(--surface-2);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--r-md);
        padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;
        cursor: pointer;
        box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
        transition:
          border-color 0.15s,
          transform 0.12s ease,
          background-color 0.15s;
      }
      .wchip:hover {
        border-color: var(--border-strong);
        background: var(--surface-3);
        transform: translateY(-1px);
      }
      /* 選択済み: amber の薄塗りで「選んだ」が一目で分かる */
      .wchip.selected-ring {
        background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12);
        border-color: var(--amber);
      }
      .wchip-urgent {
        border-color: var(--red);
      }
      /* 選択チェック / 緊急バッジ */
      .w-check {
        color: var(--amber);
        font-weight: 900;
      }
      .w-urgent-badge {
        background: var(--red);
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 0.58rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        border-radius: 4px;
        padding: 0 0.3rem;
        margin-left: 0.25rem;
      }
      .w-top {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.35rem;
      }
      .w-name {
        white-space: nowrap;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-overflow: ellipsis;
        max-width: 7.5rem;
      }
      .w-meta {
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin: 0.15rem 0;
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      }
      .w-wait {
        font-size: 0.66rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .wchip .track {
        margin-top: 0.35rem;
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }
      .pref {
        font-size: 0.6rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        border-radius: 4px;
        padding: 0 0.3rem;
        margin-left: auto;
      }
      .pref-blue {
        background: var(--blue);
        color: white;
      }
      .pref-green {
        background: var(--green);
        color: white;
      }
      .pref-any {
        background: #475569;
        color: white;
      }

      /* ===== ログ ===== */
      .log {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.15rem;
        max-height: 64vh;
        overflow-y: auto;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        padding-right: 4px;
      }
      .log-row {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.4rem;
        padding: 0.22rem 0.4rem;
        border-radius: var(--r-sm);
        background: var(--surface-1);
        border-left: 3px solid var(--border-strong);
      }
      .log-time {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }
      .log-settle {
        border-left-color: var(--green);
      }
      .log-arrival {
        border-left-color: var(--blue);
      }
      .log-rage,
      .log-bust {
        border-left-color: var(--red);
      }
      .log-open,
      .log-swap,
      .log-combine {
        border-left-color: var(--amber);
      }

      /* ===== 共通 ===== */
      .empty-hint {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        padding: 1rem;
        text-align: center;
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
      }
      .empty-hint.small {
        padding: 0.5rem;
      }

      /* ===== トースト ===== */
      .toast {
        position: fixed;
        left: 50%;
        bottom: 1.5rem;
        transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(2rem);
        background: var(--surface-3);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
        color: var(--ink);
        padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
        border-radius: var(--r-md);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        opacity: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        transition: all 0.25s;
        z-index: 50;
      }
      .toast.show {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);
      }
      .toast-bad {
        border-color: var(--red);
      }
      .toast-good {
        border-color: var(--green);
      }

      /* ===== 結果画面 ===== */
      .result-overlay {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        background: rgba(8, 14, 11, 0.78);
        display: none;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        z-index: 60;
        backdrop-filter: blur(3px);
      }
      .result-overlay.show {
        display: flex;
      }
      .result-card {
        background: var(--surface-1);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
        border-radius: var(--r-lg);
        padding: 1.5rem 1.8rem;
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 460px;
        width: 92%;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      }
      .result-rank {
        font-size: 3.2rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        line-height: 1;
      }
      .rank-S {
        color: #d97706;
      }
      .rank-A {
        color: #059669;
      }
      .rank-B {
        color: #2563eb;
      }
      .rank-C {
        color: #6b7280;
      }
      .rank-D {
        color: #dc2626;
      }
      .result-title {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        margin-top: 0.3rem;
      }
      .result-comment {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        margin: 0.3rem 0 0.9rem;
      }
      .result-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 0.4rem 1rem;
        text-align: left;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
      .result-grid > div {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border);
        padding: 0.2rem 0;
      }
      .result-grid span {
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .result-grid b.bad {
        color: var(--red);
      }
      .result-restart {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 0.7rem;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }
      .result-best {
        display: inline-block;
        margin: 0.1rem 0 0.6rem;
        padding: 0.2rem 0.7rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: #fef3c7;
        color: #b45309;
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
      }

      /* ===== ランキング（リザルト内）===== */
      .rank-submit {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      }
      .rank-name {
        flex: 1;
        min-width: 0;
        min-height: 44px;
        padding: 0.5rem 0.7rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
        border-radius: var(--r-md, 8px);
        background: var(--surface-2);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }
      .rank-submit-btn {
        flex: 0 0 auto;
        min-height: 44px;
        padding: 0.5rem 0.9rem;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .rank-note {
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        min-height: 1rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
        text-align: left;
      }
      .ranking-head {
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        text-align: left;
        margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
      }
      .ranking-list {
        text-align: left;
        max-height: 220px;
        overflow-y: auto;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
      .ranking-empty {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        padding: 0.6rem 0;
      }
      .ranking-row {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.6rem 1.4rem 1fr auto;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        padding: 0.3rem 0.4rem;
        border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border);
        border-radius: 6px;
      }
      .ranking-me {
        background: #fff7ed;
        outline: 2px solid #f59e0b;
      }
      .ranking-pos {
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--muted);
        text-align: center;
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      }
      .ranking-badge {
        font-weight: 900;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .ranking-name {
        overflow: hidden;
        text-overflow: ellipsis;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .ranking-profit {
        font-weight: 700;
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      }

      /* ===== 開店前設定（店員数）オーバーレイ ===== */
      .setup-overlay {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        background: rgba(8, 14, 11, 0.78);
        display: none;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        z-index: 70;
        backdrop-filter: blur(3px);
      }
      .setup-overlay.show {
        display: flex;
      }
      .setup-card {
        background: var(--surface-1);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
        border-radius: var(--r-lg);
        padding: 1.6rem 1.8rem;
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 420px;
        width: 92%;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      }
      .setup-title {
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        font-weight: 900;
      }
      .setup-lead {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 0.5rem 0 1.1rem;
      }
      .setup-lead b {
        color: var(--ink);
      }
      .setup-stepper {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 1.2rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
      }
      .setup-step-btn {
        min-width: 48px;
        min-height: 48px;
        font-size: 1.6rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        line-height: 1;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--surface-2);
        color: var(--ink);
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .setup-step-btn:disabled {
        opacity: 0.35;
        cursor: not-allowed;
      }
      .setup-count {
        min-width: 4.5rem;
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      }
      .setup-count b {
        font-size: 2.6rem;
        font-weight: 900;
      }
      .setup-count span {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-left: 0.2rem;
      }
      .setup-range {
        font-size: 0.74rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .setup-wage {
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin: 0.5rem 0 1.1rem;
      }
      .setup-start {
        width: 100%;
        min-height: 48px;
        font-size: 1rem;
      }

      /* ===== フッター ===== */
      .page-foot {
        max-width: 1280px;
        margin: 1.2rem auto 2.5rem;
        padding: 0 1rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
      }
      .page-foot summary {
        cursor: pointer;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--ink);
      }
      .page-foot ul {
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin: 0.5rem 0;
      }
      .credit code {
        background: var(--surface-2);
        padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }

      /* ===== 利益サブ表示（HUD）===== */
      .rev-sub {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.7rem;
        font-size: 0.66rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-top: 0.1rem;
      }
      .rev-sub b {
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        color: var(--ink);
      }
      .rev-sub b.bad {
        color: var(--red);
      }

      /* ===== 店員カード ===== */
      .staff-card {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        background: var(--surface-1);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-left: 3px solid #7c3aed;
        border-radius: var(--r-md);
        padding: 0.5rem 0.7rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
        box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
      }
      .staff-info {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        font-size: 0.74rem;
      }
      .staff-emoji {
        font-size: 1rem;
      }
      .staff-count b {
        font-size: 1rem;
      }
      .staff-detail,
      .staff-wage {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      }
      .staff-actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.3rem;
      }
      .mini[disabled] {
        opacity: 0.45;
        filter: grayscale(0.4);
      }

      /* ===== 卓の席: 点棒・親・希望・開始待ち ===== */
      .seat-pts {
        font-weight: 800;
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
      }
      .seat-dealer {
        background: #b45309;
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 0.58rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        border-radius: 4px;
        padding: 0 0.25rem;
        margin-left: 0.2rem;
      }
      .seat-cust .pref,
      .seat-staff .pref {
        margin-left: 0.2rem;
      }
      .seat-wait {
        font-size: 0.64rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .seat-wait-urgent {
        color: var(--red);
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      /* ===== レスポンシブ（スマホ）===== */
      @media (max-width: 960px) {
        .main {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
        .hud {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          gap: 0.5rem;
        }
        .clock {
          font-size: 1.4rem;
        }
        /* 進行ボタンは HUD から下部固定バーへ移す（親指リーチ）。 */
        .hud .advance-wrap {
          display: none;
        }
        .advance-bar {
          display: block;
          position: fixed;
          left: 0;
          right: 0;
          bottom: 0;
          z-index: 40;
          padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem calc(0.5rem + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
          background: var(--surface-1);
          border-top: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
          box-shadow: 0 -2px 10px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
        }
        .advance-bar .btn-advance {
          min-height: 48px;
          font-size: 1rem;
        }
        /* 下部バーに最終要素が隠れないよう余白を確保。 */
        .app {
          padding-bottom: 5rem;
        }

        /* ログをタップで開閉（既定は折りたたみ）。 */
        .log-toggle {
          display: flex;
          align-items: center;
          justify-content: space-between;
          cursor: pointer;
          min-height: 44px;
          margin: 0;
          padding: 0.4rem 0.2rem;
        }
        .log-caret {
          display: inline-block;
          transition: transform 0.15s;
        }
        .log-toggle-cb:checked ~ .log-toggle .log-caret {
          transform: rotate(180deg);
        }
        .log-toggle-cb:not(:checked) ~ #log {
          display: none;
        }
        #log {
          max-height: 40vh;
        }

        /* タップ領域の拡大（min 44px・間隔 >=10px）。 */
        .mini {
          min-height: 44px;
          padding: 0.55rem 0.9rem;
          font-size: 0.85rem;
        }
        .tc-actions {
          gap: 0.5rem;
        }
        .wchip {
          padding: 0.7rem 0.75rem;
          min-height: 48px;
        }
        .btn {
          min-height: 44px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
